## How to Run Tests

### Quick Start
```bash
cd vscode-extension
npm test                    # Run all tests
npm test -- --coverage      # With coverage report
npm test -- --watch         # Watch mode (development)
```

### Specific Tests
```bash
npm test -- manager.test.ts                    # Single file
npm test -- manager.test.ts -t "Binary"        # Specific category
npm test -- --testNamePattern="Constructor"    # By pattern
```

### Coverage Analysis
```bash
npm test -- --coverage
npm test -- --coverage --verbose
npm test -- --coverage --collectCoverageFrom="src/**/*.ts"
```

