## Next Immediate Actions

### 1. Install Dependencies & Build (This Week)
```bash
cd vscode-extension
npm install
npm run esbuild
```

### 2. Run Full Test Suite
```bash
npm test -- --coverage
```

### 3. Validate Cross-Platform Binaries
- Build with `bash scripts/build-binaries.sh`
- Test on macOS, Linux, Windows (or VMs)

### 4. Test Locally in VS Code
```bash
code . && F5
```

### 5. Document Coverage Results
- Record coverage percentage
- Identify gaps for Phase 3
- Plan additional tests if needed

